# The same match as match.case, with player one scripted after "Go!":
# walk right for a second, jump, attack. Scores the dynamics -- walk speed,
# jump arc, animation timing -- not just the settled frame. Dolphin runs the
# match.case menu route, then the same three inputs in dump frames
# (port frame + 1530). The port holds the stick with an explicit hold count
# because its stick tokens auto-release after four frames.
description: VS match with P1 walking, jumping and attacking (Onett)
run_frames: 340
ref_frames: 2400
align: search
window: 8
ref_lead: -1530
env: MELEE_BOOT_MODE=14
env: MELEE_BOOT_MATCH=13,12,9,0,0
input: 130: right*60
input: 220: x
input: 260: a
ref_input: 236:+START
ref_input: 240:-START
ref_input: 400:+START
ref_input: 404:-START
ref_input: 760:MAIN:0.5:0.0
ref_input: 768:MAIN:0.5:0.5
ref_input: 820:+A
ref_input: 824:-A
ref_input: 950:+A
ref_input: 954:-A
ref_input: 1000:P2:+A
ref_input: 1004:P2:-A
ref_input: 1060:MAIN:0.5:1.0
ref_input: 1120:MAIN:0.5:0.5
ref_input: 1130:MAIN:1.0:0.5
ref_input: 1140:MAIN:0.5:0.5
ref_input: 1150:MAIN:0.5:0.0
ref_input: 1157:MAIN:0.5:0.5
ref_input: 1170:+A
ref_input: 1174:-A
ref_input: 1180:P2:MAIN:0.5:1.0
ref_input: 1240:P2:MAIN:0.5:0.5
ref_input: 1250:P2:MAIN:1.0:0.5
ref_input: 1260:P2:MAIN:0.5:0.5
ref_input: 1270:P2:MAIN:0.5:0.0
ref_input: 1277:P2:MAIN:0.5:0.5
ref_input: 1290:P2:+A
ref_input: 1294:P2:-A
ref_input: 1340:+START
ref_input: 1344:-START
ref_input: 1420:MAIN:0.5:1.0
ref_input: 1452:MAIN:0.5:0.5
ref_input: 1480:+A
ref_input: 1484:-A
ref_input: 1660:MAIN:1.0:0.5
ref_input: 1720:MAIN:0.5:0.5
ref_input: 1750:+X
ref_input: 1754:-X
ref_input: 1790:+A
ref_input: 1794:-A
checks: 180, 235, 300
